        Constraint-Driven Small <span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> Models Based on <span class="search-hit mathjax">Agent</span> and OpenAlex Knowledge Graph: Mining Conceptual Pathways and Discovering Innovation Points in Academic Papers
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Xia%2C+Z">Ziye Xia</a>, 
      
