    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Classifying and Addressing the Diversity of Errors in <span class="search-hit mathjax">Retrieval</span>-<span class="search-hit mathjax">Augmented</span> Generation Systems
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
